WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.950
ALEX: OpenAI just gave healthcare AI the
ability to actually *do* things —

00:00:03.950 --> 00:00:07.901
ALEX: not answer questions, but click
through software, fill out forms, move
across

00:00:07.901 --> 00:00:11.851
ALEX: systems. That's a different animal
entirely.

00:00:11.961 --> 00:00:14.808
JAMIE: And they dropped more than twenty
new plugins on the same day.

00:00:14.808 --> 00:00:17.655
JAMIE: That's not an update, that's a
statement.

00:00:17.765 --> 00:00:20.836
RUFUS: The statement being: we would
like to be inside your hospital's
software

00:00:20.836 --> 00:00:23.908
RUFUS: stack before anyone asks
permission.

00:00:24.121 --> 00:00:28.519
ALEX: We'll get into what that means.
November 17th, 2026.
